OL,3,GNEWSALucy's Law: A real bite on NI's
OL,4,Aillegal puppy trade or a toothless
OL,5,Aattack?
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegislation, known as Lucy's Law, to
OL,8,Fhelp tackle Northern Ireland's illegal
OL,9,Fpuppy trade was approved on Wednesday.
OL,11,FIf introduced as planned, it would put
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland on a par with the rest
OL,13,Fof the UK by making third-party puppy
OL,14,Fand kitten sales illegal.
OL,16,FAgriculture and environment Minister
OL,17,FAndrew Muir has called it "a major
OL,18,Fstep" forward in disrupting dealer
OL,19,Fchains and strengthening safeguards for
OL,20,Fpuppies and kittens.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
