OL,3,GNEWSALucy's Law: A real bite on NI's
OL,4,Aillegal puppy trade or a toothless
OL,5,Aattack?
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome front-line rescue workers,
OL,8,Fhowever, have argued that the
OL,9,Fregulations do not go far enough,
OL,10,Fclaiming gaps have been left that could
OL,11,Fcontinue to be exploited.
